<section class="vision section" id="vision">
  <div class="vision-copy"><p class="eyebrow">03 / From vision to reality</p><h2>Great spaces<br/>start with<br/><em>a clear vision.</em></h2><p>Before the first foundation, there’s an idea. Explore how lines become structure, and structure becomes a place to live.</p><a class="text-link" href={url('services/3d-design/')}>Explore our 3D design approach <span>↗</span></a></div>
  <div class="model-wrap" data-model>
    <div class="model-fallback" aria-label="Illustrative architectural house framework"><svg viewBox="0 0 600 400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"><g fill="currentColor" style="opacity:var(--build,.25)"><path d="M130 160 290 220 290 330 130 270Z"/><path d="M290 220 480 130 480 240 290 330Z"/><path d="M130 160 190 75 320 20 480 130 290 220Z"/></g><path d="M80 290 290 370 530 240 320 170 80 290M130 270V160l190-90 160 60v130M130 160l160 60 190-90M290 220v150M130 270l160 60 190-90M180 290V180M235 310V200M340 340V200M400 310V175M450 280V150M130 160l60-85 130-55 160 110M190 75l100 145M290 220 320 70" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg></div>
    <div class="model-top"><span>FIG. 01 — A STUDY IN FORM</span><span>INTERACTIVE 3D</span></div>
    <div class="model-controls"><label for="model-progress">Blueprint <span>Built form</span></label><input type="range" id="model-progress" min="0" max="100" value="50" aria-label="House construction progress"/><button class="model-reset" type="button">Reset view ↺</button></div>
    <p class="model-note">Illustrative model · not a completed Sigura project</p>
  </div>
</section>
